Write a testimonial request email to {{ $json.customerName }}.

Company sending request: using {{ $json.productOrService }}
Requester: {{ $json.requestedBy || 'the team' }}
Customer title/company: {{ $json.customerTitle ? $json.customerTitle + ' at ' + $json.customerCompany : $json.customerCompany || 'not specified' }}
Their use case: {{ $json.useCase || 'not specified' }}
Known success metric: {{ $json.successMetric || 'not specified' }}
Submission link: {{ $json.submissionUrl }}

Write the email. It should feel personal and low-pressure. End with the link.

